Capability sentinel for the checkpoint-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/checkpoint
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises Ptah's migration checkpoint capability
(`ptah migrations checkpoint` plus checkpoint-aware `up`, `status`, `validate`,
and `down`), which Atlas keeps in its proprietary Pro build: Atlas OSS prints
"'atlas migrate checkpoint' is not supported by the community version." These
fixtures are intentionally separate from the Atlas schema round-trip corpus
because they measure a Ptah-native capability (stokaro/ptah#660).
